<title>USA: Northrop, Boeing in door pact.</title>
<headline>Northrop, Boeing in door pact.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northrop Grumman Corp said it was selected by Boeing Co to produce aircraft doors in an agreement with a potential value of more than $400 million.</p>
<p>Northrop said the deal calls for it to produce doors for Boeing 737, 757 and 767 airplanes and additional doors for the 747.</p>
<p>The new work extends into the next century.  The total value will depend on the number of aircraft delivered.</p>
</text>
